# {{.AppName}}

Monorepo scaffolded with [fxkit](https://github.com/fitan/fxkit). One Go module, services under `services/`.

## Layout

```
.
├── docker-compose.yml   # postgres / hatchet / consul / otel
├── deploy/postgres/     # extra DBs created on first postgres start
├── go.mod
├── Makefile
└── services/
    └── <name>/
        ├── cmd/main.go
        ├── configs/config.yaml
        └── internal/hello/
```

## Add a service

```bash
fxkit new mysvc
# HTTP-only bundle:
fxkit new mysvc --minimal
```

## Run

```bash
make run SVC=mysvc
# or
go run ./services/mysvc/cmd serve --config services/mysvc/configs/config.yaml
```

Visit:

- `GET /greet/{name}` — sample Huma handler
- `GET /docs` — Scalar API reference
- `GET /healthz` — liveness

Local ports default to `8080` per service; change `server.port` or pass `--port` when running more than one.

## Local middleware

`fxkit.Default()` 可选依赖（Postgres、Hatchet、Consul、OTLP）由仓库根 `docker-compose.yml` 提供：

```bash
make infra
make hatchet-token   # 复制为 HATCHET_CLIENT_TOKEN；也可在 http://localhost:8888 Settings → API Tokens 查看
```

| 服务 | 端口 | 用途 |
|------|------|------|
| postgres | 5432 | gormx / outbox / Casbin（库 `fxkit`）；Hatchet 库 `hatchet` |
| hatchet | 8888 / 7077 | dashboard / gRPC |
| consul | 8500 | 注册与发现 |
| otel-lgtm | 4317 / 3300 | OTLP gRPC / Grafana（admin/admin） |

服务配置示例（按需打开对应开关）：

```yaml
db:
  driver: postgres
  dsn: "postgres://fxkit:fxkit@localhost:5432/fxkit?sslmode=disable"
hatchet:
  enabled: true
  token: "<paste make hatchet-token>"
  host_port: "localhost:7077"
otel:
  enabled: true
  endpoint: "localhost:4317"
discovery:
  consul_address: "http://localhost:8500"
  register: true
```

停止：`make infra-down`（保留 volume）。鉴权 IdP 不在此栈；本地用 `auth.dev_header_user` + `X-User`。

## Config

Each service has `services/<name>/configs/config.yaml`. Override with Consul KV (`--consul` / `--consul-key`) or CLI `--port`.
